OL,3,GNEWSACalls for government to stop
OL,4,Anursery closure plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Labour group in an area where the
OL,7,Fparty lost all bar one of its
OL,8,Fcouncillors in May has urged the
OL,9,Feducation secretary to halt the closure
OL,10,Fof 10 publicly run nurseries that the
OL,11,Fformer administration had been
OL,12,Freviewing.
OL,14,FThe plan to axe South Tyneside
OL,15,FAccredited Network for Learning in the
OL,16,FEarly Years (Stanley's) by July next
OL,17,Fyear was confirmed on 23 September by
OL,18,Fthe now Reform-led cabinet.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
