OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACalls for government to stop
OL,4,Anursery closure plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Shields Labour Party said it had
OL,7,Fasked Lucy Powell to look at whether
OL,8,Fthe borough can meet its statutory
OL,9,Fchildcare duties, but the council said
OL,10,Fthere remained "sufficient
OL,11,Fgood-quality" nursery places.
OL,13,FThe BBC has asked the Department for
OL,14,FEducation how it has responded to the
OL,15,Frequest to intervene.
